<title>POLAND: OLAWA 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>OLAWA 96 NET FALLS TO PLN 3.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results December</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.13 vs   0.21</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.24 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.14 vs   0.07</p>
<p> Sales		    3.89 vs   3.37</p>
<p>JANUARY-DECEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     3.01 vs   3.06</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 5.27 vs   5.01</p>
<p> Operating profit     4.47 vs   4.39</p>
<p> Sales		   48.75 vs  41.90</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish non-ferrous metals smelter is</p>
<p>Huta Olawa SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
